<h2 id="custom-attribute-syntax">Custom Attribute Syntax</h2>

<div class="language-json highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="nl">"Custom.&lt;FieldName&gt;"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"&lt;Value&gt;"</span><span class="w">
</span></code></pre></div></div>

<p>Where:</p>
<ul>
  <li><code class="highlighter-rouge">&lt;FieldName&gt;</code> is the exact name of the custom field as defined in the template.</li>
  <li><code class="highlighter-rouge">&lt;Value&gt;</code> is the value you’d like to assign to that field.</li>
</ul>

