<h2 id="tips-for-success">Tips for Success</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Custom field names must be an <strong>exact match</strong> (case-sensitive).</li>
  <li>Prefix <code class="highlighter-rouge">Custom.</code> is <strong>mandatory</strong>.</li>
  <li>You may include <strong>as many custom fields</strong> as are defined in the template.</li>
  <li>Use the <strong>API playground</strong> to generate and validate request payloads.</li>
</ul>

